{"lyrics":"[Intro: Eric Idle & Young Thug]\n[00:00.70] Some people say it's folly, but I'd rather have the lolly\n[00:03.52] With money, you can make a smash\n[00:06.00] There is nothing quite as wonderful as money, money, money, money\n[00:09.78] There is nothing like a newly minted pound\n[00:11.74] (Money, money, money, money)\n[00:13.12] Everyone must hanker for the butchness of a banker\n[00:15.86] It's accountancy that makes the world go 'round, 'round, 'round, 'round\n[00:18.88] You can keep your Marxist ways, for it's only just a phase\n[00:22.46] Money, money, money makes the world go 'round (Yee)\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[00:27.68] Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[00:29.52] I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[00:32.52] I go military boys with the angles (Gah-gah, phew-phew)\n[00:35.82] Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[00:39.24] Lot of blue cash in a rubber band (A lot of blue cash in the rubber)\n[00:43.08] Mount it up her ass, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n[00:46.28] Tropicana diamonds, rock 'em by the tens (By the tens)\n[00:48.90] I'm just drinkin' Act, Kurt Cobain (Cobains)\n[Verse 1: Young Thug]\n[00:52.04] Money on your dawg and go bust his brains (Grrt)\n[00:54.46] Leave him on the sidewalk like he gettin' a tan (Graow)\n[00:58.48] I grow micro-soft drinkin' oxygen (Graow)\n[01:01.66] Bitch, I been a boss since a god-damn kid (Woo)\n[01:04.46] Hop out on the block with a AK, make him do the cha-cha-cha (Skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:07.70] I rode the Dropbox with your bae and I got my rocks off, woo (Got my rocks off)\n[01:10.86] She sucked the socks off of me and they was Gucci (Woo)\n[01:14.14] I bent her over in the Bentley Spur and I didn't eat her coochie (On God)\n[01:17.30] I'm livin' life as a pimp (Yeah)\n[01:18.22] I'll put a bitch on your shrimp (Yeah)\n[01:20.10] I'm high in the sky like a blimp (High)\n[01:21.74] Ooh, I'll cop a Rolls-Royce first attempt (Skrrt)\n[01:23.40] What's the definition of real? Yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:25.80] When you kneel, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:27.00] You just showin' you steal, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:28.46] Yeah (Let's go)\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[01:30.04] Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[01:33.24] I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[01:36.56] I go military boys with the angles (Gah-gah, phew-phew)\n[01:39.64] Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[01:42.30] Lot of blue cash in a rubber band (A lot of blue cash in the rubber)\n[01:46.56] Mount it up her ass, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n[01:50.30] Tropicana diamonds, rock 'em by the tens (By the tens)\n[01:52.90] I'm just drinkin' Act, Kurt Cobain (Cobains)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:55.56] Fresh to death, Gucci on my tomb\n[01:58.70] My chopper sing, it need autotune\n[02:02.02] Bad bitch in my hotel room\n[02:04.82] Take a perky right before we fuck, then act a fool\n[02:07.98] Sad money, I got blue face diamonds\n[02:09.64] I'm at the top, and I'm gonna keep on climbin'\n[02:11.32] I got a gun on my hip, no silence\n[02:12.90] I want these niggas to hear the violence\n[02:14.44] Momma told me, \"Don't trust nobody\"\n[02:16.02] Damn, momma, you seen it coming\n[02:17.46] That's why I don't keep this heat for nothin'\n[02:19.20] Try me, then you're gettin' one\n[02:21.16] Plus one and a couple more, uh\n[02:23.88] 30 shots when I am all done\n[02:27.62] Right, right? Did I do the math right?\n[02:31.16] Stomp 'em out, wrath in my Rafs, feel my wrath\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[02:34.06] Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[02:37.30] I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[02:40.56] I go military boys with the angles (Gah-gah, phew-phew)\n[02:43.64] Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[02:47.24] Lotta blue cash in a rubber band (A lotta blue cash in the rubber)\n[02:50.54] Mount it up her ass, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n